+# Billing classifications
+
+Billing questions are classified by `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` and routed to human review.
+
+- A message containing the case-sensitive text `refund` is classified as `refund-review`.
+- Every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+These labels select human review; they do not establish that a refund was approved, an invoice was corrected, or another financial outcome occurred.

